I have updated the man page for the game WANDERER 2.2.
It is in a shar file is attached to this posting.

When using the # to toggle to the full screen display, if help is
desired, the help menu doesn't clear away the entire debug window.

I have made an addition to help.c that clears the screen in debug_mode
that I thought you might want.


